      "finding": "Description-behavior mismatch: declared purpose is 'Use curl to call GitLab REST APIs for commits/MRs, comments, merges, assignments, and user lookups.' but code also performs: Accesses a local credentials file that is not declared in the skill description or permissions., Exposes credential contents to stdout instead of performing the declared GitLab API actions..",
